OL,3,GNEWSABlue plaque honour for longest
OL,4,Afootball phone-in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blue plaque has been unveiled to mark
OL,7,Fthe 40th anniversary of the UK's
OL,8,Flongest-running football phone-in show.
OL,10,FRadio Sheffield's Praise or Grumble was
OL,11,Ffirst broadcast on 16 November 1986 to
OL,12,Fgive disgruntled fans of clubs in South
OL,13,FYorkshire and North Derbyshire the
OL,14,Fchance to moan about their team's
OL,15,Fperformance on a Saturday afternoon.
OL,17,FInitially dedicated to grumbles, the
OL,18,Fshow's unique format was soon expanded
OL,19,Fto include praise.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
